WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:14.590
Believe it or not, I love people.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.660
Some people.

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:19.630
Oh, wait. I have something to show you.

00:00:19.630 --> 00:00:19.640
What?

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.150
Oh. You didn't.

00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:25.470
Don't tell me, every schmuck is getting one.

00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:27.790
I don't even know what they are.

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:29.320
I just don't always trust them.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:31.920
Oh. Thank you.

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.300
They have a bad habit of leaving.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:50.840
Hey. Oh, my new haircut.

00:00:51.470 --> 00:00:54.860
Keep it in your pants, perv.

00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:58.010
Things though, things I trust.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.740
Things are made to last.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:02.470
From place to place.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:11.120
From generation to generation. It's why I
take stuff and keep it.

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:17.530
So the people can stay with me. If that makes
me a klepto, so be it.

00:01:18.370 --> 00:01:28.470
Because when the people we love are gone and
memories fade, what the hell else keeps them alive?

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:28.480
Oh.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:35.720
You gotta be fucking kidding me.

